Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0349: Picker sizing fix, Enhance's item picker gets its
 own tabs

- Fixed the real bug behind truncated names: .craft-picker-td-name's old max-width:0 trick was fighting the Details column for space under auto table layout. Switched to table-layout: fixed with a real 38% floor for Name.
- Raised PickerModal default maxWidth (420/520 -> 680/620) and craft-picker-list's scroll cap (320px -> 420px); removed the now-redundant Alchemist-specific maxWidth override
- EnhanceStation's item picker: new tabs (Equipped, Unequipped, one per hero), tags derived from heroId
- guild-idler-status.md updated with the patch 0349 entry
